I would **not** start a broad `KR-TOPOLOGY` experiment yet.

I would first create:

## **D4.5 — Observational Separation & Quotient**

with the following definitions to derive:

$$
\boxed{D_{4.5.1}\quad Observable}
$$

$$
\boxed{D_{4.5.2}\quad Observation\ Domain}
$$

$$
\boxed{D_{4.5.3}\quad Admissible\ Observation}
$$

