**This is, in my view, the most useful extraction from the mathematical source for KnowledgeOS right now.** It strengthens D1/D4/D5, gives us the missing vocabulary for the probabilistic/infinite-state question, and keeps us from prematurely declaring a topological or probabilistic ontology.

